# Spike: medical content (audio recordings, source notes, transcriptions)
# These contain real-style clinical text and should not be committed.
spike/data/audio/*
spike/data/converted/*
spike/data/transcriptions/*
spike/data/ground_truth/*
spike/data/corrected/*
spike/data/reports/*
spike/data/sample_text_recordings.docx
!spike/data/**/.gitkeep

